{"ref":"BDB, בְּעוֹר","hw":"בְּעוֹר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעוֹר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>a burning;</em> 𝔗 <em>torch</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Balaam <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:5\" href=\"/Numbers.22.5\">Nu 22:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">31:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.5\">Dt 23:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:22\" href=\"/Joshua.13.22\">Jos 13:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:9\" href=\"/Joshua.24.9\">24:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:5\" href=\"/Micah.6.5\">Mi 6:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:3\" href=\"/Numbers.24.3\">Nu 24:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:15\" href=\"/Numbers.24.15\">15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בנו ב׳)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּלַע</span>, a king of Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:32\" href=\"/Genesis.36.32\">Gn 36:32</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.43\">1 Ch 1:43</a>.","next":"BDB, בַּעֲשֵׂיָה","prev":"BDB, בַּעֲרָא"}